  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Second alpha. Autolink now covers Markdown editor properties, the keywords screen links page names to the backoffice editor beside the front-end URL, and the relation type migration no longer fails the plan when another relation type already carries its name. Built and verified against Umbraco 17.6.1 on .NET 10.",
